{"id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-partial-function.md","title":"部分函数与部分相等","display":"df-partial-function — 部分函数与部分相等","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-partial-function","aliases":["20-df-partial-function"],"display":"df-partial-function — 部分函数与部分相等","chapter":"2","section":"2.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 2.1.7；Notation 中的部分函数约定","source_pdf_pages":[60],"source_printed_pages":[24],"depends_on":["[[20-df-strings]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-partial-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-partial-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-partial-function — 部分函数与部分相等"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 2.1.7；Notation 中的部分函数约定"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>60</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>24</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> 为集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\\subseteq X\\times Y\">\\(f,g\\subseteq X\\times Y\\)</span> 为候选图；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y,z\\in Y\">\\(y,z\\in Y\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>；取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\omega^k\">\\(X=\\omega^k\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y=\\omega\">\\(Y=\\omega\\)</span> 时，输入变量也记作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\">\\(\\vec x\\)</span>。集合、自然数、有限序列及集合上的良基递归采用 ZFC 的基础语言。</p>\n<p>部分函数箭头适用于下游出现的配置、有限串及自然数等集合载体；它不是只对自然数图才有意义的未声明类型转换。以下停止、发散与部分相等记号均通过图成员关系解释。</p>\n<p>数值函数的元数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 使用下文的载体 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Arg}_k\">\\(\\mathsf{Arg}_k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\)</span> 始终是长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 的序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Arg}_k\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Arg}_k\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\mathsf{Arg}_k\\rightharpoonup\\omega\">\\(h:\\mathsf{Arg}_k\\rightharpoonup\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in\\omega\">\\(v\\in\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pack}_k\">\\(\\operatorname{pack}_k\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{unpack}_k\">\\(\\operatorname{unpack}_k\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ev}_k\">\\(\\operatorname{ev}_k\\)</span> 的图由 Assertion 给出；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a)\">\\((a)\\)</span> 采用上游的单项序列定义。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nf:X\\rightharpoonup Y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nf\\subseteq X\\times Y\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\ \\forall y,z\\in Y\\\n[((x,y)\\in f\\land(x,z)\\in f)\\Rightarrow y=z],\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(f):=\\{x\\in X:\\exists y\\in Y\\ ((x,y)\\in f)\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ran}(f):=\\{y\\in Y:\\exists x\\in X\\ ((x,y)\\in f)\\},\\\\\nf(x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ (x,y)\\in f,\\qquad\nf(x)\\downarrow\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists y\\in Y\\ [f(x)\\downarrow=y],\\\\\nf(x)\\uparrow\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\\\\nf(x)\\simeq g(x)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n(f(x)\\uparrow\\land g(x)\\uparrow)\\lor\n\\exists y\\in Y\\ [f(x)\\downarrow=y\\land g(x)\\downarrow=y],\\\\\nf\\simeq g\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall x\\in X\\ [f(x)\\simeq g(x)],\\\\\nf:X\\to Y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n(f:X\\rightharpoonup Y)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=X.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nf:X\\rightharpoonup Y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nf\\subseteq X\\times Y\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\ \\forall y,z\\in Y\\\n[((x,y)\\in f\\land(x,z)\\in f)\\Rightarrow y=z],\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(f):=\\{x\\in X:\\exists y\\in Y\\ ((x,y)\\in f)\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ran}(f):=\\{y\\in Y:\\exists x\\in X\\ ((x,y)\\in f)\\},\\\\\nf(x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ (x,y)\\in f,\\qquad\nf(x)\\downarrow\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists y\\in Y\\ [f(x)\\downarrow=y],\\\\\nf(x)\\uparrow\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\\\\nf(x)\\simeq g(x)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n(f(x)\\uparrow\\land g(x)\\uparrow)\\lor\n\\exists y\\in Y\\ [f(x)\\downarrow=y\\land g(x)\\downarrow=y],\\\\\nf\\simeq g\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall x\\in X\\ [f(x)\\simeq g(x)],\\\\\nf:X\\to Y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n(f:X\\rightharpoonup Y)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=X.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\nf:\\omega^k\\rightharpoonup\\omega\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nf\\subseteq\\omega^k\\times\\omega\\land\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\ \\forall y,z\\in\\omega\\\n[((\\vec x,y)\\in f\\land(\\vec x,z)\\in f)\\Rightarrow y=z],\\\\\nf(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ (\\vec x,y)\\in f,\\\\\nf(\\vec x)\\simeq g(\\vec x)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n(f(\\vec x)\\uparrow\\land g(\\vec x)\\uparrow)\\lor\n\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ [f(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\land g(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y]\n\\quad(f,g\\subseteq\\omega^k\\times\\omega).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\nf:\\omega^k\\rightharpoonup\\omega\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nf\\subseteq\\omega^k\\times\\omega\\land\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\ \\forall y,z\\in\\omega\\\n[((\\vec x,y)\\in f\\land(\\vec x,z)\\in f)\\Rightarrow y=z],\\\\\nf(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ (\\vec x,y)\\in f,\\\\\nf(\\vec x)\\simeq g(\\vec x)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n(f(\\vec x)\\uparrow\\land g(\\vec x)\\uparrow)\\lor\n\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ [f(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\land g(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y]\n\\quad(f,g\\subseteq\\omega^k\\times\\omega).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathsf{Arg}_k:=\\begin{cases}\\omega&amp;k=1,\\\\\\omega^k&amp;k\\ne1,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{pack}_k:\\omega^k\\to\\mathsf{Arg}_k,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{pack}_k(\\vec x):=\\begin{cases}x_0&amp;k=1,\\\\\\vec x&amp;k\\ne1,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{unpack}_k:\\mathsf{Arg}_k\\to\\omega^k,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{unpack}_k(a):=\\begin{cases}(a)&amp;k=1,\\\\a&amp;k\\ne1,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{unpack}_k(\\operatorname{pack}_k(\\vec x))=\\vec x,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{pack}_k(\\operatorname{unpack}_k(a))=a,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ev}_k(h,\\vec x)\\downarrow=v\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n(\\operatorname{pack}_k(\\vec x),v)\\in h.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathsf{Arg}_k:=\\begin{cases}\\omega&amp;k=1,\\\\\\omega^k&amp;k\\ne1,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{pack}_k:\\omega^k\\to\\mathsf{Arg}_k,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{pack}_k(\\vec x):=\\begin{cases}x_0&amp;k=1,\\\\\\vec x&amp;k\\ne1,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{unpack}_k:\\mathsf{Arg}_k\\to\\omega^k,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{unpack}_k(a):=\\begin{cases}(a)&amp;k=1,\\\\a&amp;k\\ne1,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{unpack}_k(\\operatorname{pack}_k(\\vec x))=\\vec x,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{pack}_k(\\operatorname{unpack}_k(a))=a,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ev}_k(h,\\vec x)\\downarrow=v\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n(\\operatorname{pack}_k(\\vec x),v)\\in h.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>数值一元函数的图以自然数为输入；机器的输入向量和有限串仍以序列为对象。pack 与 unpack 明确给出两者的转换，ev 只在声明的数值元数上求值；没有把长度一序列与它唯一的元素认定为相同集合。零元载体仍是含空序列的单点集，多元载体仍为原来的序列集合。</p>\n<p>原有自然数版本是一般集合载体版本的同一实例；没有为发散增添一个输出值。对单值图，部分相等与图相等一致。候选关系是否单值由箭头右侧的谓词判定，不能仅因写出候选图就预先假定单值性。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 2.1.7；Notation 中的部分函数约定；印刷页 24；PDF 第 60 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"f,g\\subseteq X\\times Y","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"y,z\\in Y","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"X=\\omega^k","display":false},{"tex":"Y=\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Arg}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in\\omega^k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathsf{Arg}_k","display":false},{"tex":"h:\\mathsf{Arg}_k\\rightharpoonup\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"v\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pack}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{unpack}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ev}_k","display":false},{"tex":"(a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nf:X\\rightharpoonup Y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nf\\subseteq X\\times Y\\land\n\\forall x\\in X\\ \\forall y,z\\in Y\\\n[((x,y)\\in f\\land(x,z)\\in f)\\Rightarrow y=z],\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(f):=\\{x\\in X:\\exists y\\in Y\\ ((x,y)\\in f)\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{ran}(f):=\\{y\\in Y:\\exists x\\in X\\ ((x,y)\\in f)\\},\\\\\nf(x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ (x,y)\\in f,\\qquad\nf(x)\\downarrow\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists y\\in Y\\ [f(x)\\downarrow=y],\\\\\nf(x)\\uparrow\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ x\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\\\\nf(x)\\simeq g(x)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n(f(x)\\uparrow\\land g(x)\\uparrow)\\lor\n\\exists y\\in Y\\ [f(x)\\downarrow=y\\land g(x)\\downarrow=y],\\\\\nf\\simeq g\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall x\\in X\\ [f(x)\\simeq g(x)],\\\\\nf:X\\to Y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n(f:X\\rightharpoonup Y)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(f)=X.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\nf:\\omega^k\\rightharpoonup\\omega\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nf\\subseteq\\omega^k\\times\\omega\\land\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^k\\ \\forall y,z\\in\\omega\\\n[((\\vec x,y)\\in f\\land(\\vec x,z)\\in f)\\Rightarrow y=z],\\\\\nf(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ (\\vec x,y)\\in f,\\\\\nf(\\vec x)\\simeq g(\\vec x)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n(f(\\vec x)\\uparrow\\land g(\\vec x)\\uparrow)\\lor\n\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ [f(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y\\land g(\\vec x)\\downarrow=y]\n\\quad(f,g\\subseteq\\omega^k\\times\\omega).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathsf{Arg}_k:=\\begin{cases}\\omega&k=1,\\\\\\omega^k&k\\ne1,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{pack}_k:\\omega^k\\to\\mathsf{Arg}_k,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{pack}_k(\\vec x):=\\begin{cases}x_0&k=1,\\\\\\vec x&k\\ne1,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{unpack}_k:\\mathsf{Arg}_k\\to\\omega^k,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{unpack}_k(a):=\\begin{cases}(a)&k=1,\\\\a&k\\ne1,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{unpack}_k(\\operatorname{pack}_k(\\vec x))=\\vec x,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{pack}_k(\\operatorname{unpack}_k(a))=a,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ev}_k(h,\\vec x)\\downarrow=v\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n(\\operatorname{pack}_k(\\vec x),v)\\in h.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":4179,"backlinks":[{"id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]。"},{"id":"c6c42d8d708f182d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-partial-function]]。"},{"id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tmcomp]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]。"},{"id":"42a23ade1ce9e8e9","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]。"},{"id":"a4daa2d7bdea73d3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。"},{"id":"8cea21e174a04417","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-partial-function]]。"},{"id":"0cdf7f1474a3271f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直